00:16:54.257 --> 00:16:55.887
Where the shore was woven into the light

00:16:56.027 --> 00:16:57.087
We're close.

00:16:57.367 --> 00:16:57.887
Yes.

00:16:59.867 --> 00:17:00.457
If...

00:17:00.537 --> 00:17:01.657
Huh?

00:17:01.737 --> 00:17:04.257
...we find the
Key of the Twilight...

00:17:04.337 --> 00:17:07.207
...I think I'm going
to leave for a while.

00:17:09.177 --> 00:17:12.197
If you can't reach me at all...

00:17:12.447 --> 00:17:13.607
In case that happens...

00:17:13.677 --> 00:17:14.267
What?

00:17:14.477 --> 00:17:15.577
...don't worry.

00:17:16.187 --> 00:17:17.447
"If"?

00:17:17.787 --> 00:17:19.447
That's not like you at all.

00:17:20.587 --> 00:17:21.417
And...

00:17:22.527 --> 00:17:25.857
If I don't worry
about you, who will?

00:17:26.357 --> 00:17:28.127
You'll push yourself too hard.

00:17:32.297 --> 00:17:33.267
The time has come.

00:17:41.877 --> 00:17:44.637
They've begun working
separately.

00:17:44.877 --> 00:17:46.247
Shall I follow them?

00:17:46.847 --> 00:17:48.247
Just Haseo.

00:17:48.647 --> 00:17:50.777
If he enters phase one,
you may commence.

00:17:51.247 --> 00:17:52.407
Understood.

00:17:55.457 --> 00:17:59.487
Tawaraya has one of the Cores.
What shall we do about that?

00:17:59.557 --> 00:18:02.497
Ovan is always
thinking way ahead.

00:18:02.767 --> 00:18:05.027
Don't tell Tawaraya anything.

00:18:05.127 --> 00:18:05.727
Yes.

00:18:28.587 --> 00:18:34.087
All of the Virus Cores so far
were found in the Lost Grounds.

00:18:43.537 --> 00:18:44.897
Here, too?

00:18:55.147 --> 00:18:56.277
It happened again.

00:19:03.587 --> 00:19:06.147
What is this place?

00:19:27.047 --> 00:19:29.277
Ovan's wishes.

00:19:43.067 --> 00:19:44.397
It's him.

00:19:48.167 --> 00:19:50.997
So Ovan's about to make his move.

00:19:52.577 --> 00:19:54.977
I've completed the setup.

00:19:55.037 --> 00:19:56.437
Good work.

00:19:56.507 --> 00:19:58.537
I hope it goes smoothly.

00:19:59.077 --> 00:20:00.207
Are you uncertain?

00:20:00.647 --> 00:20:01.137
No.

00:20:02.047 --> 00:20:04.947
What I want is Ovan's
character data.

00:20:05.187 --> 00:20:07.707
As long as you can
transfer the data...

00:20:07.787 --> 00:20:09.687
...there's nothing to worry about.

00:20:10.087 --> 00:20:10.577
Yes.

00:20:11.127 --> 00:20:12.857
If you can capture Ovan...

00:20:12.927 --> 00:20:14.947
...what follows will
continue as planned.

00:20:15.627 --> 00:20:16.687
Is that okay?

00:20:17.297 --> 00:20:19.997
This guild has done a lot.

00:20:21.067 --> 00:20:22.627
More than I expected.

00:20:24.007 --> 00:20:25.127
I understand.

00:20:37.687 --> 00:20:40.877
The pathway to the
Key of the Twilight...

00:20:41.957 --> 00:20:42.817
...has been opened.

00:20:44.257 --> 00:20:46.917
All the Virus Cores are
different colors...

00:20:46.997 --> 00:20:50.257
...and the pillars at Coite-Bodher
match those colors.

00:20:50.667 --> 00:20:54.627
We can safely assume that's where
the Virus Cores are to be used.

00:20:54.697 --> 00:20:56.297
I don't remember
anything like that.

00:20:56.367 --> 00:20:58.927
Remember the five little pillars?

00:20:59.207 --> 00:21:00.367
Right...

00:21:00.437 --> 00:21:03.637
But this is probably...

00:21:07.777 --> 00:21:09.907
Isn't it a little too easy?

00:21:10.317 --> 00:21:12.407
It couldn't just happen by chance.

00:21:17.057 --> 00:21:18.917
The Key of the Twilight...

00:21:19.857 --> 00:21:23.087
It can turn the core program
of this game upside down.

00:21:23.327 --> 00:21:28.497
This entity lives
within the core program...

00:21:29.367 --> 00:21:30.667
...or it may exist in the program.

00:21:35.507 --> 00:21:37.207
Is there more than one?

00:21:37.477 --> 00:21:38.777
Or just one?

00:21:39.517 --> 00:21:41.567
It would be enough to
answer this question alone.

00:21:52.027 --> 00:21:55.957
This is our only chance to
get a head start on TaN.

00:22:03.537 --> 00:22:04.867
The time for action...

00:22:07.537 --> 00:22:08.097
...has come.

00:22:08.507 --> 00:22:10.877
I'm going, too.

00:22:30.027 --> 00:22:33.627
Ikiru wa dokuhai kiyu no kurushimi wo
Life is a poisoned cup of needless suffering

00:22:33.697 --> 00:22:37.187
Nomihosu sube wo dare ga sazukeyo
That no one can show me how to drain

00:22:37.467 --> 00:22:40.867
Taiyo ni sumu toiu kenja no washi
A wise eagle is said to live in the sun

00:22:40.937 --> 00:22:45.307
Habataki dake ga kodama suru
The flapping of its wings
is all that echoes

00:22:48.817 --> 00:22:52.337
Kono futatsu no me ni yadotta
In each of these eyes

00:22:52.417 --> 00:22:56.047
Yami to Hikari sono docchi de
Dwell darkness and light

00:22:56.127 --> 00:23:03.357
Boku wa ashita wo mitsumeru beki nano darou
Through which shall I look to tomorrow?

00:23:03.427 --> 00:23:07.097
Kawaki kitta gareki no machi
A dried out and ruined city

00:23:07.167 --> 00:23:10.867
Ten to sen wo tsunagi awase
Draws the lines between the dots

00:23:10.937 --> 00:23:17.867
Imi nado nai koto bakari afurete iku
Causing meaningless events to overflow

00:23:18.047 --> 00:23:21.777
Honou no gotoki kodoku
Soothing the loneliness

00:23:21.847 --> 00:23:24.877
Idaku karada shizumete wa
That flames up within the body

00:23:24.947 --> 00:23:32.417
Ankyo eto shitatatte iku shizuku
Droplets of water fall towards the culvert

00:23:32.657 --> 00:23:35.857
Kakageru dokuhai kono sei wa michitemo
Even if the poisoned cup is upheld
and filled with this life

00:23:35.927 --> 00:23:40.027
Kogareru shino yume wa nagare tsuku
My dream that yearns for death
drifts into it

00:23:40.137 --> 00:23:43.727
Toride ni kuikomu tsume kokou no washi
The eagle remains aloof;
its talons dig into the fort

00:23:43.807 --> 00:23:47.367
Habataki dake ga maiagaru
Only the flapping of its wings resounds

00:23:47.437 --> 00:23:51.167
Ano soukyu ni takkei ni shite kure tamae
Let me be crucified in the blue sky

00:23:51.247 --> 00:23:54.937
Ten to chi ga musubu basho ni
bokuwa tatsu
I'll stand where heaven and earth meet

00:23:56.287 --> 00:23:59.247
Next Episode...
